    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "# Tag 1.0.0\n\n`git show 1.0.0:src/components/layout/navbarFilters.svelte`\n\nGood visual reference, not a file in HEAD.",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "# Primitive order\n\n`FAB view -> search pill -> FAB sort`\n\nThe searchbox is inline and central.",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "# Style intent\n\nCircular accent FABs, 2.25em, soft shadow.\n\nSearch pill is flexible, 26px high, 999px radius, transparent input.",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "# Current order\n\n`crear -> right-side cluster`\n\nCluster contains view, sort, search trigger, and conditional node expansion.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "# Search became island\n\nThe input is inside `.vm-toolbar-search-island`, an absolute card opened from a search trigger.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "# More buttons exist now\n\nFnR mode, flags, help, history, crear, operation scope, node expansion, field visibility, and mouse gesture behavior must be preserved.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "# Existing tests\n\nTests currently protect the right-side cluster and searchbox island. They need migration, not deletion.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "d100000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1220,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "# Target silhouette\n\n`[view FAB] [inline search pill] [sort FAB]`\n\nRecover the navbarFilters visual read.",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "d100000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1220,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "# Preserve capabilities\n\nMove new primitives into slots:\n\n- center leading: FnR mode\n- center trailing: clear/category/flags/help\n- center action: crear\n- overflow: node expansion/extras",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "d100000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1220,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "# Architecture move\n\nUse `ToolbarPrimitive`, `filtersToolbarAdapter`, `resolveToolbarModel`, and a dumb renderer. Do not add more branches directly to `Toolbar.svelte`.",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "d100000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1220,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "# Regression stance\n\nThis is conceptual restoration: keep the 1.0.0 visual intent, adapt to HEAD structure.",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "e100000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "# Tests to update\n\nReplace cluster-order assertions with `view -> search -> sort` contract. Keep coverage for crear, expansion, FnR, search flags, and hooks.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "e100000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "# Verification commands\n\nTargeted component tests, `pnpm check`, and `git diff --check` before claiming the implementation is done.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "e100000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 390,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "# Risk\n\nA literal checkout from `1.0.0` would remove modern toolbar behavior. A pure style patch may leave layout semantics broken.",
      "color": "2"
    }
  ],
